OL,3,AGrand Theft Auto 6 gets UK release
OL,4,Aafter 13-year wait for gamers around
OL,5,Athe world
OL,6,
OL,7,FGrand Theft Auto 6 has been released in
OL,8,Fthe UK, ending the 13-year wait for a
OL,9,Fnew instalment of the game
OL,11,FThe game has been gradually released at
OL,12,Fmidnight across different time zones -
OL,13,Fmeaning many people across the world
OL,14,Fhave already had the chance to play it
OL,16,FFrom 23:00 GMT, we'll be presenting
OL,17,Ffrom XP Tavern - a gaming lounge in
OL,18,FLondon - taking your live questions and
OL,19,Fanswering them with expert journalists,
OL,20,Fstreamers and gamers - you'll be able
OL,21,Fto watch live at the top of this page
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
